  "notes": "A tongue-in-cheek 'Palantir for family trips': GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22/#30363d, #58a6ff blue, #3fb950 green, #d29922 amber), 'UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS' green classification tag, all-caps letter-spaced headings, tiny blue eyebrow labels above every section heading (SHARED COSTS, SELECTED EXPENSE, SPLIT MODE, BRIEFING, CHECKLIST, NOTES). 2px corners throughout, no shadows, 1px #30363d outlines. Status colour coding: amber for OPEN/outstanding, green for SETTLED/checked. 'Working as' persona switch (Parkers/Jiangs/Riveras) stands in for login; every record carries 'Created by / Last edited by' family stamps. The right aside header gets a lighter #1f2a34 fill and a blue top line on selection change. Notes can be converted to tasks ('Note to task')."
